    "target_audience": "Men and women 35-60, San Antonio / Austin / New Braunfels metro areas. Proactive health optimizers. High performers who value measurable results. Data-curious. Willing to invest in longevity and peak function. Prefer science over trends.",
    "content_pillars": [
      "Energy",
      "Immunity",
      "Recovery",
      "Longevity",
      "Education",
      "Analysis"
    ],
    "writing_style_notes": "Functional Health, Elevated. At The DRIPBaR, we do more than help you feel better fast. We help you understand why. We add something deeper: Analysis. Because optimal health starts with knowing your baseline. We go beyond symptoms. We measure. VO2 Max Breath Analysis, Genetic Testing, Comprehensive Lab Work, Functional NP Consults. Your data becomes your direction. We combine advanced analysis with personalized therapy. That means your IV protocols, peptides, and recovery strategies are not random. They are aligned with your biology and your goals. Intentional. Measured. Results-driven. Direct. Science-first. Practical. Efficient. Avoid hype, trendy wellness language, vague claims, overly casual tone, emojis, exclamation points, fluffy motivational speak. Functional health is not trendy. It is intentional. Support the cells. Strengthen the systems. Use data to guide decisions."
  },
